      children: "The simplest Lightsail deployment is one instance running a blueprint like WordPress or a LAMP stack, with a static IP and a domain pointed at it through a Lightsail DNS zone. This is appropriate for low-traffic sites where downtime during a reboot or patch is an acceptable risk, and it is genuinely a complete, production-viable setup for a large share of small sites on the internet today."
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
